{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/12","id":4999987725,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVVaUws8AAAABKgXCDQ","html_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/pull/12","diff_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/pull/12.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/pull/12.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/issues/12","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/12/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/12/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/issues/12/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/statuses/eda6f680032f7ae90d2d76f0fc0a64934cba1d1f","number":12,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add an actual Seoul route client / 실제 서울 경로 클라이언트 구현","user":{"login":"dicebattle","id":445458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTQ1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/445458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle","html_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A local browser can now request a real Seoul route through the version-aware gateway and two Valhalla nodes. Previously, the UI only replayed evidence. The new client renders the actual returned geometry and clears obsolete routes on input changes, publication changes, expiry, timeout or unavailability.\n\n로컬 브라우저가 버전을 검증하는 중계와 Valhalla 노드 두 개에 실제 서울 경로를 요청합니다. 기존 화면은 근거 재생용이었고, 새 클라이언트는 실제 반환 지형을 표시하며 입력·게시 변경·만료·시간 초과·사용 불가 시 이전 경로를 지웁니다.\n\n- Reuse pinned MapLibre/esbuild, local road assets and strict browser-only contracts. Keep gateway credentials server-side and fault controls on private IPC. English/Korean, keyboard submission and390px layouts are included.\n- Main directly ran clean whole334 and unit285; independently inspected12,225 hashes,27 client native pairs/12 browser-map bindings and exact cleanup. Actual IAB and102.8s Chrome demo confirm baseline, detour, failover, expiry and unavailable states.\n- Preserve original evidence, earlier failures, exact map omissions, recording/source hashes and P10's corrected hosted proof/protected merge. Both READMEs now describe the actual client.\n\n고정 MapLibre/esbuild·로컬 지도·브라우저 전용 계약을 재사용하고 중계 인증값·장애 제어를 공개하지 않습니다. 메인이 전체334개·단위285개·원문 해시와 엔진/브라우저 연결·정리를 확인했습니다. 한영·키보드·390픽셀과 실제102.8초 시연을 검증했고 이전 실패·지도 제외·출처/해시·P10 보호 반영을 보존합니다.\n\nEvidence: [P11 report](https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/blob/feat/p11-route-client/research/pilot/2026-10-25-p11/report.md), [design](https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/blob/feat/p11-route-client/docs/30-p11-route-client.md). This is synthetic traffic on real OSM, not real-driving accuracy or production authentication. Hosted checks are running; P12–P14 and independent geographic evaluation remain.\n\n근거는 위 보고서·설계 문서에 있습니다. 실제 OSM 위 합성 교통 검증이며 실주행 정확도·운영 인증을 주장하지 않습니다. 원격 검사는 진행 중이고 P12~P14·독립 지역 평가가 남습니다.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-24T23:08:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T23:08:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9993d01925d3f16a721b05ab99227eeaea58a1da","assi